# item30: Plage01 route, walked end to end. No teleport commands. Segments A-D are the measured
# walks from local/reports/item30-plage01-walk.md (hut, beach nav walk incl. the running jump
# over the crate wall, TouchTrigger8/7 + killer, truck return legs + Porte1).
#
# No weapon is granted by default in the current walked route: the player fights with the
# level's own picked-up Beretta. NOTE (item30c spec task 1): the spec asks this fixture to keep
# the `weapon XIII.m60` grant (the Beretta ammo mis-wiring was the original reason). The grant is
# restored below (t=51.30): the game's own `Weapon.GiveTo`/`ChangedWeapon` path, measured working
# (rapid fire, 45/hit contact). It is kept because the merged origin/main tree made the beach
# soldiers lethal (IAController.Init `Pawn.Health *= 5` -> 750 hp, XIDPawn Landed flip) and the
# route-survival arithmetic is still being re-measured (report round 7): the m60 is the only
# weapon with the belt depth to matter.
#
# The killer (BaseSoldier6) walks while attacking, so the view is tracked onto it around the
# firing (`track BaseSoldier6` / `track off`).

# ---- hut: key, Beretta, door (all walked) ------------------------------------------------
# All times include the +2.2 s intro offset measured after the origin/main merge (control
# returns at ~46.8 s now, not ~45.0 s): inputs issued while the intro suppresses input are
# dropped, so the segment A jumps must land after the handback.
t=51.30 weapon XIII.m60
