# The last round empties the weapon (the clip and the reserve). The kill itself lands on fire
# 25 (measured item30c_e39); the shore soldiers woken by the gunfire (item41c hearing) close in
# - they chase along the nav path and their crossfire killed the player in scratch e24.
t=469.75 fire
# The corpse search is the game's own auto-search: the corpse's `XIIIPawn.Dying.Timer` sets
# `bSearchable` on its first tick, and the player pawn's own `XIIIPlayerPawn.Tick` auto-search
# (0x017B..0x024F: `bAutoPickup` -> `SearchPawn(XP)` -> `Inventory.Transfer` -> `AddInventory`)
# drains it as soon as the player's cylinder overlaps the dead pawn's (`Touching`). The corpse
# sits at the killer's stake-out (-5582,-9821), 59 UU from the firing spot, so the player walks
# onto it (the truck key is then carried into the return legs below).
t=470.60 goto -5570.0 -9805.0

